      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners consistently highlight that their pets return home happy, thoroughly exercised, and eager to return for daycare or overnight stays. Although one customer reported that their dogs were left unfed during boarding, the vast majority praise the staff for safely managing playtime and accommodating reactive dogs."
      }
