        "en": "Welcoming and supportive kennel team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the friendly front-desk greetings, curbside assistance for seniors, and reassuring telephone consultations. While one reviewer expressed dissatisfaction with staff transparency regarding suite arrangements, most pet parents describe an attentive team that addresses questions and tracks dog medication diligently."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
