      "title": {
        "en": "Clean suites and spacious play yards"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers describe the boarding facilities and play yards as neat, well-maintained, and secure for dogs of all sizes. One client raised concerns about warehouse ventilation and lack of air conditioning in standard kennel suites, whereas other owners praise the organized indoor rooms and dedicated walking yards."
      }
    }
